ption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-02T23:05:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T04:57:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1.stable.mono, 4.5.beta4.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta4.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8600K CPU @ 3.60GHz (6 threads) - 15.94 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the POT Generation feature for a scene it will erroneously generate an entry for an instanced Label that has the Auto Translate property set to Disabled, and the Text property set to an override from the instanced version. \n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Load the provided MRP project\n2. Open `Project` > `Project Settings` \n3. Navigate to `Localization` > `Pot Generation`\n4. Press `Generate POT`\n5. Save the file as `messages.pot`\n6. Observe that `messages.pot` contains an entry with the `msgid` \"Override\" despite the label that this message originates from having the Auto Translate property set to disabled\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[auto_translate_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21562948/auto_translate_mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109256/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}